  "instructions": [
    "Soak the dried shrimp in water overnight, then drain and chop into small pieces.",
    "In a blender, combine coconut milk, ginger, lemongrass, fish sauce, soy sauce, honey, and grass-fed lard. Blend until smooth.",
    "Add the chopped dried shrimp to the blender and blend until well combined.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a bowl and stir in chopped cilantro.",
    "Thread the shrimp mixture onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Preheat the robata grill to 400°F (200°C). Grill the skewers for 2-3 minutes per side, or until lightly charred.",
    "Serve immediately, garnished with thinly sliced Vietnamese peppers."
